    "body": "Problem: No explicit recommendations about how to check for possible issues related to `vim.pack`.\r\n\r\nSoltuion: Mention `:checkhealth vim.pack` explicitlye as a recipe.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nResolve #41586, as checking the full integrity of Git repo (present `HEAD`, `origin` remote, etc.) is not exactly trivial and duplicates what is already done in `:checkhealth vim.pack`. Pointing at running it as a more visible part of `:h vim.pack` feels like an okay solution here.",
